WEBVTT

00:00:00.370 --> 00:00:02.870
This girl is Kouyama Mitsuki. 12 years old.

00:00:02.870 --> 00:00:05.930
Recently, she recorded a 
TV show for the first time. {Edit Block, will return to it}

00:00:06.080 --> 00:00:08.050
She failed time after time due to her lack of experience.

00:00:08.270 --> 00:00:11.090
She almost didn't get to sing <i>Myself.</i>

00:00:11.370 --> 00:00:14.450
However, after receiving words of 
encouragement from a former idol...

00:00:14.620 --> 00:00:17.040
<i>Full Moon's </i> TV debut was a big success.

00:00:17.040 --> 00:00:19.870
I'm starting to become 
a little used to this business.

00:00:20.340 --> 00:00:21.070
Well, then...

00:00:21.070 --> 00:00:22.870
...I wonder what's going to happen today.

00:00:22.900 --> 00:00:23.450
Huh?

00:00:27.640 --> 00:00:28.820
Do you understand?

00:00:29.100 --> 00:00:29.670
Yes.

00:02:06.860 --> 00:02:09.140
Thanks to these pictures you took...

00:02:09.310 --> 00:02:12.620
The Guitar Fighters' popularity has gone down.

00:02:12.620 --> 00:02:13.890
Is that so?

00:02:14.520 --> 00:02:17.100
You really stabbed them in the back, huh?

00:02:18.060 --> 00:02:20.610
Aren't you afraid that their spirits will come back to haunt you?

00:02:20.860 --> 00:02:23.070
If I was afraid of ghosts...

00:02:23.070 --> 00:02:24.950
I wouldn't be in this line of work.

00:02:25.490 --> 00:02:28.570
Well, what do you want 
from me, Mr. Superstitious?

00:02:29.870 --> 00:02:32.410
I want some new faces.

00:02:32.410 --> 00:02:35.660
If we have no scoops, 
our weekly pictorials won't sell.

00:02:35.830 --> 00:02:37.670
Well, how about this girl?

00:02:38.210 --> 00:02:39.790
Our next target, huh? {edited}

00:02:41.130 --> 00:02:42.050
<i>Full Moon.</i>

00:02:42.750 --> 00:02:45.130
A sixteen year old idol who debuted recently.

00:02:45.340 --> 00:02:49.800
But, her real name and her background information are unknown to the public. {data sounds weird, even though it was used here}

00:02:50.720 --> 00:02:51.810
I see.

00:02:51.810 --> 00:02:52.760
<i>Full Moon</i>, huh?

00:02:56.480 --> 00:02:59.020
Alright, alright! You're listening to Radio Name!

00:02:59.230 --> 00:03:01.060
Next, we have a question 
by Furuta Muntaro-kun.

00:03:01.060 --> 00:03:04.860
<i>"Full Moon-san, what kind of 
artist do you want to be?"</i>

00:03:05.530 --> 00:03:06.490
That's what it says...

00:03:06.820 --> 00:03:07.490
So, how about it?

00:03:07.900 --> 00:03:09.870
Do you have any goals?

00:03:09.870 --> 00:03:11.280
Ah, well...

00:03:14.490 --> 00:03:17.040
Well, for now, I just want to keep on singing...

00:03:17.040 --> 00:03:20.460
...and keep on sending my feelings.

00:03:20.630 --> 00:03:21.750
Sending your feelings?

00:03:21.750 --> 00:03:23.590
Are you singing for someone special?

00:03:23.800 --> 00:03:24.380
Eh?

00:03:26.260 --> 00:03:27.420
That's...  {naisho}

00:03:28.800 --> 00:03:30.260
That's a secret.

00:03:30.340 --> 00:03:31.930
A secret, huh?

00:03:32.300 --> 00:03:33.720
By the way, <i>Full Moon-san...</i>

00:03:33.720 --> 00:03:35.100
How about your real name?

00:03:35.350 --> 00:03:37.930
Ah, right, that's also a secret.

00:03:38.270 --> 00:03:39.900
Hmm, I see. {hmmm? was it kept intentionally, thet third "m"}

00:03:39.980 --> 00:03:41.690
Everything is a secret, huh?

00:03:41.900 --> 00:03:42.270
Yes.

00:03:53.280 --> 00:03:55.290
Tomorrow is your magazine cover photo shoot.

00:03:55.990 --> 00:03:58.210
You'll be with Shounen Drill's Shirakawa-kun. {Shounen Drill, huhuhu}

00:03:58.330 --> 00:04:00.120
Wow, really?

00:04:00.580 --> 00:04:01.370
That's right.

00:04:01.370 --> 00:04:02.670
A collaboration for the first time! {Missing line, dunno if a.f.k  did this.}

00:04:06.300 --> 00:04:07.760
We're going to take the long way, okay? {I wanted to use scenic route, sounds more actionesque}

00:04:07.960 --> 00:04:08.300
Eh?

00:04:20.520 --> 00:04:22.520
Ooshige-san, is something wrong?

00:04:23.060 --> 00:04:24.060
We're being followed.

00:04:24.310 --> 00:04:25.690
Eh, followed?

00:04:26.690 --> 00:04:27.570
Don't look!

00:04:27.570 --> 00:04:28.860
You're going to get your picture taken...

00:04:29.780 --> 00:04:32.240
...by a tabloid photographer, Saegusa. {I would have liked to use tabloid photographer, or paparrazi}{shani: changed it to your first preference}

00:04:33.240 --> 00:04:34.870
Whether it's an artist's private life,{'s added}

00:04:35.030 --> 00:04:37.080
or rumors of an actor's relationship, {changed to singular - relationship}

00:04:37.290 --> 00:04:40.270
he's a bastard who'll get the dirt on anyone. {makes more sense than everyone}{end time changed}

00:04:42.250 --> 00:04:44.460
He's probably been following us from the studio.

00:04:44.840 --> 00:04:49.050
Surely, he has been taking Mitsuki's picture the whole time. {thinking aloud, hence the third-person}{Shani: makes sense.}

00:04:49.260 --> 00:04:49.840
Eh?

00:04:50.300 --> 00:04:51.340
This is bad.

00:04:52.050 --> 00:04:53.340
Ooshige-san?

00:04:55.220 --> 00:04:56.560
They're late!

00:04:56.560 --> 00:04:58.950
Geez, they're late! {they learned the error of their ways, no more -tachi}

00:04:58.950 --> 00:05:01.120
What are those two doing 
by themselves anyways?

00:05:05.190 --> 00:05:06.120
What's this?

00:05:16.640 --> 00:05:17.720
Lens? {Meroko's tone says there should be a ?}

00:05:22.040 --> 00:05:24.100
He's really persistent.

00:05:24.100 --> 00:05:26.500
If he keeps this up, I won't be able to drop you off, Mitsuki.

00:05:27.170 --> 00:05:29.030
This is kinda scary.

00:05:43.370 --> 00:05:44.270
Damn it! {Even scumbags abide by the law}

00:05:45.820 --> 00:05:47.590
Looks like we lost him.

00:05:48.110 --> 00:05:51.020
Saegusa won't let you go that easily once he targets you.

00:05:51.020 --> 00:05:52.780
Just like a hyena.

00:05:53.040 --> 00:05:56.600
There is no celebrity who can get away once he sets his eyes on them. {edited: singular, also, them should remain them}

00:05:56.600 --> 00:05:59.740
But, I don't have anything for him to aim at. {Sadly, you kinda do}

00:06:00.120 --> 00:06:03.960
Mitsuki, you haven't said your real name, or profile in public, right?

00:06:04.920 --> 00:06:08.610
For a guy like him, that's like hitting the jackpot.

00:06:08.610 --> 00:06:09.420
That can't be...

00:06:09.970 --> 00:06:10.860
It's okay.

00:06:10.860 --> 00:06:14.200
If anything happens, everyone in the office will do anything to protect you.

00:06:14.470 --> 00:06:16.130
You aren't alone.

00:06:17.050 --> 00:06:17.620
Right.

00:06:23.430 --> 00:06:24.430
Thank you for the ride.

00:06:25.110 --> 00:06:25.940
Mitsuki.

00:06:26.390 --> 00:06:26.750
Yes?

00:06:27.030 --> 00:06:29.340
Maybe I should take you to your house?

00:06:29.740 --> 00:06:31.550
No, that's all right.{}

00:06:31.550 --> 00:06:32.420
I see.

00:06:33.410 --> 00:06:36.740
Well, if anything happens, contact me immediately, okay?

00:06:39.120 --> 00:06:42.330
If anyone finds out my real name, I might not be able to sing anymore.

00:06:42.330 --> 00:06:44.660
I'll make sure that'll never happen.

00:06:48.420 --> 00:06:50.280
Hey, whatever you do, don't look behind you.

00:06:50.280 --> 00:06:52.170
Eh? What's wrong?

00:06:52.930 --> 00:06:53.840
You're being followed.

00:06:55.050 --> 00:06:56.530
W-Why?

00:06:56.530 --> 00:06:58.100
Looks like we didn't lose him.

00:06:58.100 --> 00:07:00.220
Oh no, what should I do?{}

00:07:00.810 --> 00:07:02.610
Just keep walking like normal.

00:07:02.610 --> 00:07:03.970
Turn at the corner.

00:07:21.490 --> 00:07:22.680
