00:08:00.580 --> 00:08:01.960
It's him.

00:08:24.850 --> 00:08:26.880
Like I said, everything was fine, right?

00:08:26.880 --> 00:08:27.380
Yeah...

00:08:27.380 --> 00:08:29.100
But... I was scared. {}

00:08:30.020 --> 00:08:31.560
