00:08:39.120 --> 00:08:41.000
Well, I have to get up early tomorrow.

00:08:41.020 --> 00:08:43.070
I am off to take a bath. {missing line?}

00:08:44.700 --> 00:08:45.710
Hey, Takuto.

00:08:49.960 --> 00:08:51.180
What is it, Meroko?

00:08:51.180 --> 00:08:53.630
