00:09:03.090 --> 00:09:06.450
Backwards means they're the opposite of the usual pattern.

00:09:06.450 --> 00:09:09.940
In other words, it's not something that will delay her death.

00:09:09.940 --> 00:09:13.020
It's something that will bring 
about her death sooner.

00:09:13.200 --> 00:09:15.020
