Why you little brat!

00:17:59.290 --> 00:18:01.650
Hurry! Hurry!

00:18:27.830 --> 00:18:29.180
I've been waiting for you.

00:18:31.650 --> 00:18:34.170
Well, give me back my camera. {lead in added}

00:18:38.290 --> 00:18:39.450
I got it.

00:18:39.450 --> 00:18:41.250
You won't listen to me anymore, huh?

00:18:43.880 --> 00:18:45.910
Come on, that's enough, okay?

00:18:52.310 --> 00:18:55.440
Hey, it's dangerous over there!

00:18:56.860 --> 00:18:59.200
Come on, come back here!

00:19:15.480 --> 00:19:16.330
Man...

00:19:16.750 --> 00:19:18.410
You got me worried! {edited}

00:19:19.260 --> 00:19:21.660
That bastard!

00:19:24.380 --> 00:19:26.130
W-What?

00:19:26.130 --> 00:19:27.260
She's floating?

00:19:43.820 --> 00:19:45.110
W-What are you?{}

00:19:50.950 --> 00:19:52.280
Vengeful spirit?{lead in shorted}

00:19:58.960 --> 00:20:00.750
What are you going to do to me?

00:20:07.970 --> 00:20:09.470
S-Stop it!

00:20:09.730 --> 00:20:10.490
I beg you!

00:20:10.490 --> 00:20:13.400
F-Forgive me, I'll do anything!

00:20:13.400 --> 00:20:14.600
L-Like this...

00:20:22.110 --> 00:20:22.800
Got it!

00:20:22.800 --> 00:20:24.070
I understand!

00:20:24.070 --> 00:20:25.640
I'll never do it again!

00:20:30.770 --> 00:20:32.000
That should do it.

00:20:37.110 --> 00:20:38.470
You did well.

00:20:41.710 --> 00:20:42.600
It disappeared.

00:20:44.170 --> 00:20:45.960
You did it, Takuto!

00:20:50.380 --> 00:20:53.890
Now we continue where we left off last week, we have <i>Full Moon-</i>san with us again.

00:20:53.890 --> 00:20:54.890
Good to have you back.

00:20:55.300 --> 00:20:56.690
I'm glad to be here.

00:20:56.990 --> 00:20:58.430
By the way, <i>Full Moon</i>-san?

00:20:58.770 --> 00:20:59.310
Yes?

00:20:59.310 --> 00:21:02.520
About your secrets, 
could you tell us one of them?

00:21:03.960 --> 00:21:05.470
I think I will keep them secret! {edited}

00:21:05.470 --> 00:21:08.030
So you're always gonna be the mysterious <i>Full Moon-</i>san, huh?

00:21:08.440 --> 00:21:08.840
Yep.

00:21:10.960 --> 00:21:12.600
Well, how about playing a song?

00:21:12.600 --> 00:21:14.780
<i>Full Moon's "Myself"</i>.

00:21:20.380 --> 00:21:23.120
If it's about Saegusa, 
you don't have to worry anymore.

00:21:23.520 --> 00:21:29.110
I don't know what happened, but he said he gave up his job and left the city. {edited: camera sounds weird}

00:21:29.110 --> 00:21:30.630
Is that so?

00:21:31.800 --> 00:21:33.780
Looks like he couldn't handle his own medicine.

00:21:33.780 --> 00:21:35.000
Probably.

00:23:06.820 --> 00:23:07.440
Wait!

00:23:07.680 --> 00:23:09.020
Hey, what's the meaning of this?

00:23:09.020 --> 00:23:10.690
We can't enter Mitsuki's house!

00:23:10.690 --> 00:23:13.030
Wait a second, I'm checking on it.

00:23:14.020 --> 00:23:16.740
Eh?! A barrier from a saint's stone! {}

00:23:16.740 --> 00:23:17.510
What's that?

00:23:17.510 --> 00:23:21.330
Generally speaking, it's like a barrier we can't get through.

00:23:21.330 --> 00:23:22.120
That's bad.

00:23:22.120 --> 00:23:24.820
We have to go back and transform her quickly!

00:23:25.290 --> 00:23:27.360
Next time on Full Moon wo Sagashite:

00:23:27.790 --> 00:23:29.960
Spring Onion Ramen and the Saint's Stone
